      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Dinsmore Homestead, a Greek Revival house on 30 acres donated in 1988, showcases five generations of the family and their enslaved workers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
